course: dictionary
lesson: 9969
title: Teachable
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Teachable describes a person or animal who is able and willing to learn. «The puppy was teachable and learned to sit in one week.» A teachable puppy listens, tries and remembers, so the word is about willingness as well as ability.
explain: It can also describe a subject or skill that can be taught. «Kindness is teachable.» This means you can learn to be kind, step by step, from the people and examples around you.
explain: Teachers also talk about «a teachable moment», which is a chance in real life to learn something useful. If a spider crawls across the classroom floor and the class learns about insects, that moment has become a lesson.
fact: Teachable means able and willing to learn, or able to be taught.
fact: Teachable is an adjective, so it describes a person, an animal, a subject or a skill.
fact: Word building helps: teach + able means able to be taught.
fact: «A teachable moment» means a real-life chance to learn something useful.
fact: A teachable person listens and tries, and a teachable animal can be trained.
exercise: «The teachable puppy learned to sit in one week.» What does teachable mean here? | *Able and willing to learn | Very fast and noisy | Sleepy all day | Lost and hungry
exercise: «Kindness is teachable.» What does this tell you? | Kindness is only for grown-ups | *You can learn to be kind | Kindness is a kind of food | Kindness cannot be learned
exercise: Ms Patel's spider in class became «a teachable moment». What does that mean? | *A real chance to learn something useful | A fight about a spider | A moment when the teacher is cross | A time when the class must sit still
test: Which word describes a child who listens, tries and learns quickly? | *teachable | famished | glum | curt
test: Teachable means | Able to sing well | *Able to be taught | Able to hide from others | Able to fly
exam: In teachable, what does the ending -able tell you? | It means not | *It means can be or able to be | It means very old | It means happening yesterday
